hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"203","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham nikley jabke ham sirf Hajj samajhtey they. Phir jab ham Sarif mein they to mujhey haiz aa gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas daakhil huey jabke main ro rahi thi. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua, kya tumhey haiz aa gaya? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aik muqaddar hai jo Allah ne Aadam ki betiyon par likh diya hai. To tum wo ada karo jo Haaji ada karta hai, magar ye ke Bait (Kaaba) ka tawaaf na karo. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se gaey ki qurbaani ki. (Bukhari: 294)"
"204","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sar mein kanghi karti thi jabke main haaeza thi. (Bukhari: 295)"
"205","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur Aap masjid mein etekaaf karney waley they, Aap unkey liye apna sar jhukaatey jabke wo apne hujrey mein hotein, to wo Aapko kanghi kartein jabke wo haaeza hotein. (Bukhari: 296)"
"206","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri god mein tek lagaaey hotey jabke main haaeza hoti, phir Quran padhtey. (Bukhari: 297)"
"207","[AI-translation] Aur Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chaadar mein leti hui thi ke mujhey haiz aa gaya. To main chupkey se nikli aur haiz key kapdey liye. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhey haiz aa gaya? Main ne kaha: Haan. To Aap ne mujhey bulaaya aur main Aap key sath chaadar mein let gai. (Bukhari: 298)"
"208","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik bartan se ghusl kartey they, ham donon junbi hotey. Aur Aap mujhey hukm detey to main tehband baandhti aur Aap mujh se lipt-tey jabke main haaeza hoti. Aur Aap apna sar meri taraf nikaaltey jabke Aap motakif hotey, to main use dhoyti jabke main haaeza hoti. (Bukhari: 299)"
"209","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein se aik jab haaeza hoti aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se lipatna chaahtey to use hukm detey ke wo apne haiz key shuru mein tehband baandhey, phir us se lipattey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum mein se kaun apni khwaahish par qaabu rakkhta hai jaisey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni khwaahish par qaabu rakhtey they. (Bukhari: 302)"
"210","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Baqra Eid ya Eid-ul-Fitr mein Eidgaah ki taraf nikley. To auraton key paas se guzrey aur farmaya: Ae auraton ki jamaat! Sadqa karo. Beshak mujhey tum aag walon mein sab se zyada dikhaai gai ho. To unhon-ne kaha: Kis wajah se Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tum laanat bahut karti ho aur shohar ki naashukri karti ho. Main ne aqal aur deen mein naaqis kisi ko tum mein se aik se badh kar aqalmand aadmi ki aqal ley jaaney wala nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey deen aur hamaari aqal ka nuqsaan kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Kya aurat ki gawahi mard ki gawahi ki aadhi jaisi nahi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye uski aqal ka nuqsaan hai. Kya jab wo haaeza hoti hai to namaz nahi padhti aur rozah nahi rakhti? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye uskey deen ka nuqsaan hai. (Bukhari: 304)"
"211","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne etekaaf kya jabke Aap key sath Aapki baaz biwiyaan thein jo istihaaza wali thein aur khoon dekhti thein. To baaz auqaat wo khoon (key liye) apne neechey tasht rakkhti thein. (Bukhari: 309)"
"212","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein mana kya jaata tha ke ham mayyat par teen (din) se zyada sog manaayein, magar shohar par chaar mahiney das din. Aur na surma lagaaein aur na khushbu lagaaein aur na rangeen kapda pehnein magar Asb ka kapda. Aur hamein paaki key waqt rukhsat di gai thi ke ham mein se aik jab apne haiz se ghusl karey to kuust-e-azfaar ki thodi (khushbu istemaal karey). Aur hamein janaazon key peechey chalney se mana kya jaata tha. (Bukhari: 313)"
"213","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apne haiz se ghusl karney key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne use hukm diya ke wo kaisey ghusl karey. Aap ne farmaya: Musk ka tukda lo aur us se paaki haasil karo. Us ne kaha: Main kaisey paaki haasil karun? Aap ne farmaya: Us se paaki haasil karo. Us ne kaha: Kaisey? Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah! Paaki haasil karo. To main ne use apni taraf kheench liya aur kaha: Us se khoon key nishaan ka peechha karo. (Bukhari: 314)"
"214","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hajjat-ul-Wada mein ehraam baandha. To main un mein se thi jinhon-ne tamattu kya tha aur qurbaani ka jaanwar sath na laai thi. To unhon-ne zikr kya ke unhey haiz aa gaya tha aur wo paak na huin yahan tak ke Arafaat ki raat daakhil ho gai. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Arafaat ki raat hai jabke main ne Umrah key sath tamattu kya tha? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Apna sar kholo aur kanghi karo aur apne Umrah se ruk jao. To main ne aisa kya. Phir jab main ne Hajj poora kar liya to Aap ne Hasba ki raat Abdur Rahman ko hukm diya aur unhon-ne mujhey Taneem se Umrah karaaya merey us Umrah key badley jo main ne (chhora) tha. (Bukhari: 316)"
"215","[AI-translation] Aur Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Zul Hijja key chaand key waqt nikley. To Rasulullah ne farmaya: Jo Umrah ka ehraam baandhna chaahaaey to ehraam baandhey. Beshak main agar qurbaani ka jaanwar sath na laata to Umrah ka ehraam baandhta. To baaz ne Umrah ka ehraam baandha aur baaz ne Hajj ka ehraam baandha. Aur unhon-ne hadees bayan ki aur apne haiz ka zikr kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur unhon-ne merey sath merey bhai ko Taneem ki taraf bheja to main ne Umrah ka ehraam baandha. Aur us mein se kisi cheez mein qurbaani aur na rozah aur na sadqa tha. (Bukhari: 317)"
"216","[AI-translation] Aur Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne un se kaha: Kya ham mein se aik jab paak ho to apni namaz ki qaza karey? To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum Harooriya ho? Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath haaeza hotin thein to Aap hamein uska hukm na detey they. Ya unhon-ne kaha: To ham aisa na kartein thein. (Bukhari: 321)"
"217","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se unkey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chaadar mein haiz aaney ki hadees (marwi hai). Phir unhon-ne is riwayat mein kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey bosa detey they jabke Aap rozey se hotey. (Bukhari: 322)"
"218","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jawaan kunwaari ladkiyaan aur pardey waliyaan ya jawaan kunwaari pardey waliyaan aur haaeza (auratein) niklein. Aur wo bhalai aur mominon ki dua mein haazir hon. Aur haaeza (auratein) Eidgaah se door rahein. Un se kaha gaya: Haaeza? To unhon-ne kaha: Kya wo Arafaat mein aur fulaan fulaan mein haazir nahi hoti. (Bukhari: 324). Hafsa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham apni jawaan ladkiyon ko donon Eidain mein nikalney se roktey they. To aik aurat aai aur Bani Khalaf key mehal mein utri. To us ne apni behan se hadees bayan ki. Aur uski behan key shohar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baarah ghazwaat kiye they, aur meri behan unkey sath chhe (ghazwaat) mein thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham zakhmiyon ka ilaaj kartein thein aur beemaaron ki teemaardaari kartein thein. To meri behan ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kya ham mein se aik par gunaah hai agar uskey paas chaadar na ho ke wo na nikley? Aap ne farmaya: Use uski saheli apni chaadar mein se pehnaaey aur wo bhalai aur Musalmaanon ki dua mein haazir ho. Phir jab Umm Atiya aaein to main ne un se poochha: Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna? Unhon-ne kaha: Merey baap (Aap par qurbaan), haan. Aur wo unka zikr na kartein thein magar kehtin thein: Merey baap (Aap par qurbaan). Main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Jawaan kunwaari ladkiyaan aur pardey waliyaan ya jawaan kunwaari pardey waliyaan aur haaeza (auratein) niklein. Aur wo bhalai aur mominon ki dua mein haazir hon. Aur haaeza (auratein) Eidgaah se door rahein. Hafsa ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Haaeza? To unhon-ne kaha: Kya wo Arafaat mein aur fulaan fulaan mein haazir nahi hoti. (324). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"219","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Umm Atiya Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham gadaley aur zard (pani) ko kuchh na samajhtey they. (Bukhari: 326)"
"220","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Safiya ko haiz aa gaya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayad wo hamein rok ley. Kya wo tumharey sath tawaaf na kar chukin? To unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To niklo. (Bukhari: 328)"
"221","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat hamal (ki haalat) mein faut ho gai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par (janaazey ki) namaz padhi aur uskey darmiyaan mein khadey huey. (Bukhari: 332)"
"222","[AI-translation] Maimoona (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke wo haaeza hotein, namaz na padhtein, jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid key saamney bichhi hui hotein. Aur Aap apni chaataai par namaz padhtey, jab Aap sajda kartey to Aap ka kuchh kapda mujhey lagta. (Bukhari: 333). Kitaab-ut-Tayammum."
